ok: start --json reports the checkpoint, network, and rpc address
ok: start reports the source network
ok: status --json reports the epoch, checkpoint, clock, and fork point
ok: status reports the fork point that start reported
ok: nothing is sealed yet, so the tip is the fork point
ok: status reports a positive clock
